{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_st02",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_st02",
  "title": "休息时间",
  "storyCode": "RI-ST-2",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e14d899930f04e9335720a212f6d48b5183761e72692622fadc7833b4afc03f6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lancet-2，我有个严肃的问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不会没电吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，关于这一点请不用担心，在出发前，可露希尔姐姐为我换上了超长续航的新型电池。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "理论上我可以在一个星期内不用补充任何能源。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且飞行器上也还有备用的电池，所以请不用担心我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道小刻那孩子怎么样了，我们回来的路上她忽然窜起来就跑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "确实，刻俄柏小姐现在的状况让人有些担忧呢，不过考虑到她旺盛的生命力，应该不用太过担心呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，好无聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "飞行器检修完毕，嘉维尔送过来的病人的病情也稳定了下来，暂时没有什么别的事可以做了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且和这里的人语言又不通，早知道就跟博士去看那什么祭典了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "飞行器是很重要的罗德岛财产，必须要好好保护才行呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说说而已，我是驾驶员，这点我当然是知道的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就好啦，Lancet-2，无聊的时候可以切休眠模式，我昨天睡了12个小时，现在根本睡不着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，确切地说，对我来说，并没有“无聊”的概念呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然我可以理解迪伦先生你现在的感情，可露希尔姐姐也经常会发出这样的感慨，以及通常这样的情况下她就会去做些奇怪的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不是第一次这么想了，Lancet-2，你和其他小车里面真的不是装了个人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是呢，我的里面是精密的电路结构，你要看吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然由于我的性格预设是女性，所以对于向异性展现身体这件事，我可能会做出一些我自己都无法预想的额外行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算要看，这种时候我肯定也是想看泳装啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泳装？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，现在可是夏天，大家穿上泳装玩水还挺正常吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样的话，我来为你播放一段海浪的音频吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别啊，这样不就显得我更惨了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......难道说，迪伦先生想看我的泳装吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "才不要啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是呢，对不起，毕竟我只是机器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，抱歉，我不是那个意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请不用介意。说起来，迪伦先生见过海吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，算是见过吧，大概是去年夏天，银灰老爷因为行程有变借用了罗德岛的飞行器，当时是我作为驾驶员送他去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到了地方后我才发现好像是个度假的地方，然后被银灰老爷邀请体验了一把VIP的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧啧，我在那时才知道，原来是贫穷限制了我对有钱人的想象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，我还有那时候的照片呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迪伦先生向往那样的生活吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？向往啊......虽然那几天确实很爽，不过真要我一直过那样的生活，我肯定是过不惯的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是在驾驶舱里吃泡面，每天日夜颠倒的生活适合我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样可不行，迪伦先生，我来为你设计一套比较科学健康的作息表吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那还是免了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真遗憾。可露希尔姐姐虽然为我设计了这个功能，但是无论是她还是博士，都从来没有用到过这个功能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，那两位确实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，不过，话又说回来，这里的部族的生活比我想象的其实也好不少，该有的都有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是呢，虽然这里比起外界的生活在便利和舒适程度上差了许多，但是也并没有什么特别不便的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "根据我的记录，这两天，迪伦先生的身体健康水平也有所回升。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的假的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就是所谓的回归自然吧？嘿，也是，毕竟说白了，所有人还不都是从这样的生活过来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，我记得嘉维尔说过，在那边的雨林中有一座巨大的瀑布，等博士回来后，去那边玩应该不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们说不定已经过去了也说不定呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士做事一向公平，我相信他们一定不会抛下我们去玩水的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是呢，在那之前，就先耐心等待吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里有叫迪伦的人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？你会说萨尔贡语？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "会。和一台机器在一起的人，嗯，应该是你没错了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "依娜姆",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_075",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叫博士的家伙让我给你带了一封信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？让我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迪伦",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......Lancet-2，看来我们有事做了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，远远地就听到水声了，没想到这座瀑布有这么大！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，我没瞎说吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，这次就原谅嘉维尔了~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，确实是相当壮观的瀑布啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特米米好像还没来的样子，先在这里休息一会儿吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好耶，我的泳装总算是没有白穿~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "战意盎然啊，小姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "燧石",
      "speakerId": "char_415_flint",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "意识到语言不通的克玛尔没有说话，只是摆出一个架势。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，反正没事做，就再陪你打几场好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "煌大姐和那个女孩子打的真激烈呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真不知道打架有什么好玩的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你在战斗的时候可不是你说的这样哦，宴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊哈哈，说的也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "话说，可颂你穿的不是泳装吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊哈哈，被你发现了。这其实是我买的户外套装，防水性还不错，勉强可以算作泳装啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还真是喜欢实用性比较强的东西诶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，虽然不是海边，不过在瀑布边玩水也挺有意思的呢！有种回归自然的感觉，可惜我没有带相机了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是呢，我也是第一次来到这样的野外，感觉比想象的要有趣多了~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是不是看错了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个难道不是小刻吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，这座瀑布不错吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "很不错。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "哈哈，我以前也很喜欢来这里洗澡。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "你好像在想事情的样子啊，博士。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "一般般。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "口气不小啊，博士。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "渡过这里，然后再走一段路，应该就要到祖玛玛的部族了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "收到特米米的来信时，我可没有想到事情会变成这样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唉，博士，我这几天一直有一件事比较苦恼，我们也算交情不错了，我就问问你好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你觉得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博——士——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了？我正在和博士说话呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看那边！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是......小刻？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "找到啦，是蘑菇海洋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "洗澡咯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起来还没恢复神智的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是她在水里打滚的样子好可爱哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，这个傻孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "干脆让她就这么玩一会儿好了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比起这个，博士，我刚才要和你说的是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你觉得我的尾巴和以前比有没有变粗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "粗了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "什么？是真的吗？完了完了，这下回去之后要注意饮食了。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "干嘛啊，博士，用那种眼神看我，尾巴可是阿达克利斯的命根！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "没注意。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "啧，果然不该指望你。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不知道，特米米那个尾巴以前可没这么粗，唉，我可不想变成那样的大尾巴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你对祖玛玛没什么想法吗？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "嗯？想法是什么意思？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "我觉得那家伙挺厉害的啊，能捣鼓出那么大的机器。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "聊聊尾巴吧。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "博士，我就知道你肯定也会感兴趣的！"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉维尔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你来了啊，特米米。你的事情办完了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯嗯嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好可爱的女孩子！嘉维尔，原来你也有这样的朋友啊，我还以为你认识的都是和你一样满脑子肌肉的家伙呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这家伙很失礼啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "细腻的皮肤，精致的五官，暗黑系的穿搭也很合身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暗黑系？很流行吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有吧，不过在一部分人里还挺受欢迎的哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我是在杂志上学来的，据说外面的人都是这么穿的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，看来你对时尚有很深的误解呢，不过也没办法，毕竟是这样的地方，会有这样错误的观念也是难免的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过没关系，就由宴姐姐我来传授给你正确的时尚知识吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉维尔，我就把她带走了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诶？诶诶诶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，随你吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总之，这下人就到齐了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去让小刻清醒一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "休息结束！小刻要继续战斗了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉维尔，她又要跑了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉维尔",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧，大家快把衣服换好了！快追！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个方向，好像是祖玛玛部族的方向......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等一下！你换得这么快的吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等我们啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什么好换掉的！就这样出发！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
